<section class="shop-moments" aria-labelledby="moments-heading">
  <div class="section-header section-header--center">
    <p class="label">Our Favorites</p>
    <h2 id="moments-heading" class="heading-lg">Made for the Moment</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="shop-moments__grid">
    <div class="shop-moments__item shop-moments__item--tall">
      <img src="/assets/images/shop-moment-1.png" alt="Pink bonbons" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <div class="shop-moments__item shop-moments__item--text">
      <p class="body-lg">Discover our collection of handcrafted bonbons, each created to offer a different kind of chocolate experience. From the bright, delicate sweetness of raspberry ganache to the buttery richness of salted caramel, every piece is made with carefully selected ingredients and finished in a smooth, delicate chocolate shell.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="shop-moments__item">
      <img src="/assets/images/shop-moment-2.png" alt="Caramel brownies" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <div class="shop-moments__item">
      <img src="/assets/images/shop-moment-3.png" alt="Chocolate cookie" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <div class="shop-moments__item shop-moments__item--text">
      <p class="body-lg">Explore roasted pistachio praline, creamy hazelnut gianduja, and other irresistible combinations designed to melt slowly and leave you wanting just one more. Whether you're treating yourself or sharing a box with someone special, these are chocolates made to be savored, one beautiful bite at a time.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="shop-moments__item">
      <img src="/assets/images/shop-moment-4.png" alt="Assorted bonbons" loading="lazy">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

